<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-FIRST STAGE RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF MURCIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-FIRST STAGE RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF MURCIA.</headline>
<dateline>MURCIA, Spain 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the first stage</p>
